      "instance_name": "transgender_battalion_stereotype",
      "label": "Transgender Battalion Stereotype",
      "description": "A derogatory stereotype that portrays transgender individuals as incompetent, in need of constant support or reinforcement, and unable to function independently or effectively in a military or other structured environment. This stereotype is used to demean and dehumanize the transgender community by implying weakness or inadequacy.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
