      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_cb1e73fb",
      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "rage",
      "label": "intense anger and aggression",
      "description": "The soldier's facial expression, with eyes squeezed shut, mouth wide open in a scream, and tense facial muscles, conveys extreme rage or aggression. This is amplified by the physical gesture of gripping the rifle tightly, suggesting a state of high emotional intensity and combat readiness.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
